        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Awesome service from Aziz, he came on a Sunday to help us out because we needed a plug installed for our new dishwasher installation on Tuesday Feb 4, 2025. Very knowledgeable and very friendly to work with. I would recommend Echo Électrique for any upcoming electrical work. Give him a call and you will be very happy with your decision!",
