        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWgrfrDSgKjte7w4PlYCn4b9A7C6mUdmKrsxZZ5hqF2CKJUAvoR=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Mr Aziz is honorable guy who installed a 200 amp panel and reconnected us to the mainline after a storm knocked out the whole region. He charged us a great rate for the install when others were charging double cuz of the storm. he worked till 7 pm on a Saturday to set us up. Will certainly use his services again.",
        "time": 1681648084,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
