        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Cold called the company after reading these google reviews and not a moments regret. Just finished up with this gentleman who kindly gave up 6 hours of his Sunday for what I naively labelled a simple job. He was Prompt, respectful, courteous and clearly competent, explaining several electrical issues, what and why he was doing as he worked. Super contented and will have him back for any further work I need done.",
